  "title": "Homemade Phyllo (or Filo) Dough",
  "description": "Make your own phyllo dough using this excellent step-by-step recipe from Chef John. It's way more fun than buying it frozen from the store!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-10T00:52:45-04:00",
